{
  "info": {
    "name": "IntegrationService + MoodleMock (Persona 1)",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para MoodleMock (8091) e IntegrationService (8084). Contratos: docs/contrato-api.md y docs/contrato-eventos.md.\n\n## Requisitos antes de probar\n1. `docker compose up -d` (RabbitMQ en 5672 / 15672)\n2. `RegistroEscolarEndpoint` corriendo en 8092 (SOAP)\n3. `MoodleMock` corriendo en 8091\n4. `IntegrationService` corriendo en 8084\n\n## Orden recomendado\n1. Carpeta 1 (`MoodleMock`): comprobar que responde con los datos semilla.\n2. Carpeta 2 (`IntegrationService`): ver estado inicial, sincronizar aval (1a y 2a vez para idempotencia), sincronizar calificaciones (RabbitMQ + SOAP/XSD) y consultar incidencias.\n3. Carpeta 3 (`RabbitMQ -> IntegrationService`): publicar `aval.resuelto` vía API de RabbitMQ y verificar que IntegrationService lo consumió.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "moodle",
      "value": "http://localhost:8091"
    },
    {
      "key": "integration",
      "value": "http://localhost:8084"
    },
    {
      "key": "rabbit",
      "value": "http://localhost:15672"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. MoodleMock (8091)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Cursos",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Regresa cursos', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().length).to.be.above(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{moodle}}/mock/moodle/cursos",
              "host": ["{{moodle}}"],
              "path": ["mock", "moodle", "cursos"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Tareas por curso (CUR-101)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Todas son de CUR-101', () => pm.response.json().forEach(t => pm.expect(t.idCurso).to.eql('CUR-101')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{moodle}}/mock/moodle/tareas?idCurso=CUR-101",
              "host": ["{{moodle}}"],
              "path": ["mock", "moodle", "tareas"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "idCurso",
                  "value": "CUR-101"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Entregas por tarea (T-10)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Regresa entregas de T-10', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().length).to.be.above(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{moodle}}/mock/moodle/entregas?idTarea=T-10",
              "host": ["{{moodle}}"],
              "path": ["mock", "moodle", "entregas"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "idTarea",
                  "value": "T-10"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Calificaciones (P1)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Todas son de P1', () => pm.response.json().forEach(c => pm.expect(c.periodo).to.eql('P1')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{moodle}}/mock/moodle/calificaciones?periodo=P1",
              "host": ["{{moodle}}"],
              "path": ["mock", "moodle", "calificaciones"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "periodo",
                  "value": "P1"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Entrega calificaciones profesores (P2)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Incluye retardo EMP-21', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().some(e => e.numEmpleado === 'EMP-21' && e.aTiempo === false)).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{moodle}}/mock/moodle/entrega-calificaciones?periodo=P2",
              "host": ["{{moodle}}"],
              "path": ["mock", "moodle", "entrega-calificaciones"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "periodo",
                  "value": "P2"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. IntegrationService (8084)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Estado (RabbitMQ y contadores)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Servicio activo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().servicio).to.eql('integration-service'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{integration}}/api/integracion/estado",
              "host": ["{{integration}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integracion", "estado"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Sincronizar aval (1a vez - publica nuevos)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Publico eventos de aval', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().eventosPublicados).to.be.above(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{integration}}/api/integracion/aval/sincronizar",
              "host": ["{{integration}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integracion", "aval", "sincronizar"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Sincronizar aval (2a vez - idempotencia: 0)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('No duplica eventos (0 nuevos)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().eventosPublicados).to.eql(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{integration}}/api/integracion/aval/sincronizar",
              "host": ["{{integration}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integracion", "aval", "sincronizar"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Sincronizar calificaciones + SOAP/XSD",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Tiene campo eventosPublicados', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('eventosPublicados'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{integration}}/api/integracion/calificaciones/sincronizar",
              "host": ["{{integration}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integracion", "calificaciones", "sincronizar"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Incidencias docentes",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Detecta retardo de EMP-21', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().incidencias.some(i => i.numEmpleado === 'EMP-21')).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{integration}}/api/integracion/incidencias",
              "host": ["{{integration}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integracion", "incidencias"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. RabbitMQ -> IntegrationService (aval.resuelto)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Publicar aval.resuelto en RabbitMQ",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('RabbitMQ enruto el mensaje', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().routed).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "escuela"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "escuela"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"message_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n    \"content_type\": \"application/json\",\n    \"delivery_mode\": 2\n  },\n  \"routing_key\": \"aval.resuelto\",\n  \"payload\": \"{\\\"idEvento\\\":\\\"{{$guid}}\\\",\\\"tipo\\\":\\\"aval.resuelto\\\",\\\"fecha\\\":\\\"2026-11-26T19:30:00Z\\\",\\\"origen\\\":\\\"aval-service\\\",\\\"datos\\\":{\\\"idEntrega\\\":\\\"ENT-101\\\",\\\"matricula\\\":\\\"A001\\\",\\\"idTutor\\\":\\\"T001\\\",\\\"estado\\\":\\\"AVALADA\\\",\\\"fechaResolucion\\\":\\\"2026-11-26T19:30:00Z\\\"}}\",\n  \"payload_encoding\": \"string\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{rabbit}}/api/exchanges/%2F/escuela.eventos/publish",
              "host": ["{{rabbit}}"],
              "path": ["api", "exchanges", "%2F", "escuela.eventos", "publish"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Verificar avales resueltos recibidos",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Recibio ENT-101', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().avalesResueltos.some(a => a.idEntrega === 'ENT-101')).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{integration}}/api/integracion/avales-resueltos",
              "host": ["{{integration}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integracion", "avales-resueltos"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
